    "detailed_description": "A gifted young scientist, Mia Lorenson, wakes up in an abandoned hospital full of questions\u2014and precious few answers. What happened to her? What happened to the world?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414650/extras/89d59382ca34c7fd74040786679775bd.poster.avif?t=1751276592\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414650/extras/89d59382ca34c7fd74040786679775bd.webm?t=1751276592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414650/extras/89d59382ca34c7fd74040786679775bd.mp4?t=1751276592\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Developed during the global pandemic, Edengate: The Edge of Life is an interactive experience reflecting on feelings of uncertainty, isolation, longing and hope.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414650/extras/e8fec5b7a0d389f94f75824c1eb2ea8b.poster.avif?t=1751276592\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414650/extras/e8fec5b7a0d389f94f75824c1eb2ea8b.webm?t=1751276592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414650/extras/e8fec5b7a0d389f94f75824c1eb2ea8b.mp4?t=1751276592\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Experience Mia\u2019s emotional journey as you explore the desolate city of Edengate, unraveling its mysteries and memories, accompanied by emotional voiceover performances and a breathtaking score by critically acclaimed composer Laryssa Okada.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414650/extras/7c3606f22d80454dbd79a3e7cba77acf.poster.avif?t=1751276592\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414650/extras/7c3606f22d80454dbd79a3e7cba77acf.webm?t=1751276592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414650/extras/7c3606f22d80454dbd79a3e7cba77acf.mp4?t=1751276592\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Find hope in the face of devastation and discover what connects us to the world.",
