3606f22d80454dbd79a3e7cba77acf.poster.avif?t=1751276592\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414650/extras/7c3606f22d80454dbd79a3e7cba77acf.webm?t=1751276592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414650/extras/7c3606f22d80454dbd79a3e7cba77acf.mp4?t=1751276592\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Find hope in the face of devastation and discover what connects us to the world.",
